<title>UK: Buenos Aires sets $250 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Buenos Aires sets $250 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF BUENOS AIRES</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     11.25     MATURITY    11.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.25     PAY DATE    11.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.25     YIELD	 11.377</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    50 BP     SELL CONC  75 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
